eck calls. Flag stays cleared. Don't reseed.\n\nThis works! Let me implement.\n\nActually, simpler: **reseed seed=3 in `create_shuffled_deck` IF a hand has been created since the last create_shuffled_deck call** (or it's the first call)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1039,"cache_read_input_tokens":200974,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1039,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"887d06a4-883f-423e-bb27-f92663194ba0","uuid":"ec7eb3fb-4ebc-49ab-90f0-f865b4a9561e"}
