atch!\n\nLet me verify my Python sim was correct earlier... actually, in my earlier sim the diff was 8 (not 0). Let me re-check what state we were at...\n\nActually the earlier sim had section 5 starting AFTER section 4's 4 calls. If iterate_hand resets, section 5 starts fresh.\n\nOK let me implement: reseed in iterate_hand:\n\nActually wait, there's a subtle issue. If iterate_hand reseeds, but section 2 has multiple iterate_hand calls (lines 176, 181, 186, 192), and between them, deal_from_deck might be called... but actually no, section 2 doesn't deal after the first 8 deals.\n\nBut section 2 has remove_from_hand calls between iterate_hands. Those don't use PRNG.\n\nOK simulating: iterate_hand reseeds (or sets flag for reseed on next deal). Section 2 ends with reseed. Section 3 starts with PRNG seed=3 fresh. Section 3 create_hand → flag set. First deal reseeds (does nothing because already at seed=3, but state advances). Hmm wait.\n\nActually, let me just implement and test:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1542,"cache_read_input_tokens":208538,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1542,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"887d06a4-883f-423e-bb27-f92663194ba0","uuid":"aac5cfff-f889-4594-b06c-66533cd37718"}
